<title>USA: Kopp group has 15.4 pct Brooks stake.</title>
<headline>Kopp group has 15.4 pct Brooks stake.</headline>
<dateline>WASHINGTON 1996-10-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>A group led by Kopp Investment Advisors Inc said in a Securities and Exchange Commission filing Monday it holds a 15.4 percent stake in Brooks Automation Inc or 1,163,250 common shares.</p>
<p>The group disclosed its latest position on Brooks in a 13G filing.</p>
<p>Filings under 13G are usually made by institutions and large investors with &quot;passive&quot; investment objectives in a company. Unlike 13D filings, those reports do not list the latest transactions.</p>
</text>
